# Hand-derivable Ballou fixture exercising inbreeding two generations back.
# pedformat asd.
#
#   1,2   unrelated non-inbred founders
#   3,4   full sibs (1 x 2)          F=0
#   5,6   full-sib matings (3 x 4)   F=0.25, f_a=0
#   7     5 x 6                      f_a = [0 + 0.25 + 0 + 0.25]/2 = 0.25
1 0 0
2 0 0
3 1 2
4 1 2
5 3 4
6 3 4
7 5 6
